Package: tncensus
Type: Package
Title: Tunisian Census Data (1891-2024 Censuses and Harmonized Panel)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Institut National de la Statistique", role = c("dtc", "cph"),
           comment = "Data collector: INS Tunisia"),
    person(given = "Mohamed Dhia",
           family = "Hammami",
           email = "mhammami@syr.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4498-8770"))
    )
Description: Comprehensive R data package for Tunisia's population censuses from 1891
    to 2024. Combines (1) the harmonized 2014-2024 delegation-level panel
    (281 delegations, 45 indicators, crosswalk, and codebook); (2) full 2014
    RGPH data (264 delegations, 169 variables, and 28 disaggregated tables);
    (3) full 2024 RGPH data (279 delegations, 24 governorates, national
    totals, 46 thematic indicators, optional secteur-level download,
    accessors, and Gini/Theil inequality functions); (4) 2004 RGPH data (264
    delegations, 24 governorates, national totals, 48 indicators); (5) 1984
    RGPH delegation-level education tables and 1966 governorate illiteracy
    data; (6) historical national education series (1956-2014) and master
    INS delegation crosswalk; (7) colonial-era population censuses
    (1891-1956); and (8) 224 tables transcribed from the 1906 European and
    1931 indigenous census publications and from the demography and health
    chapters of the Statistique generale de la Tunisie yearbooks (1921-1936
    census tables and 1902-1939 vital, migration, naturalisation, hospital,
    mortality and public-assistance series), digitized on Gallica
    (Bibliotheque nationale de France). Original contemporary data published
    by INS Tunisia <https://www.ins.tn/>.
